# Day 21- Disaster recovery & backup strategies

## Ansible backup & restore files

```yaml
- name: Backup & Restore files
  hosts: all
  become: yes
  tasks:
    - name: Create backup of /etc directory
      command: tar -cvzf /tmp/etc-backup.tar.gz /etc
    - name: Copy backup to the remote server
      copy:
        src: /tmp/etc-backup.tar.gz
        dest: /tmp/etc-backup.tar.gz
    - name: Restore backup from the remote server
      command: tar -xvzf /tmp/etc-backup.tar.gz -C /
  # Terraform - Create S3 bucket with Cross-Region Replication
  resource "aws_S3_bucket" "pathnex_bucket" {
	bucket = "pathnex_backup_bucket"
	region = "us-east-1"

	versioning {
		enabled = true
	}
      }

  resource "aws_S3_object" "pathnex_backup_file" {
	bucket = aws_S3_bucket.pathnex_bucket.bucket
	key = "backup.tar.gz"
	source = "pathnex-backup.tar.gz"
      }



